<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Inland Steel cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Inland Steel cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers steel analyst Michelle Applebaum said she cut her rating on Inland Steel Industries Inc to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/8 to 24-7/8.</p>
<p>-- said the stock is fully valued at 25-1/8 on an analysis of the sum of the component parts.</p>
</text>
